request.description:
Get all trucks for Company ID 1 (no type filter)

Endpoint: GET /api/truck-combo?companyId=1

Query Parameters:
- companyId (required): Company ID = 1
- type (optional): Not provided - returns all truck types

Response (HTTP 200 OK):
{
  "isSuccess": true,
  "statusCode": 200,
  "message": "Success",
  "data1": [
    {
      "Id": 1,
      "AccountName": "TRUCK-001"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2,
      "AccountName": "TRUCK-002"
    },
    ...
  ]
}

Security: Requires valid JWT token with ROLE_ADMIN, ROLE_SUPERADMIN, or ROLE_USER
